From: riehlies <118917105+riehlies@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:09:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Light and dark theme (src/fork/theme.css,
 src/fork/theme.js)

Proposed by kisi (riehlies/kisi, web/advanced/fork-patches/): the page follows the
browser's preference (prefers-color-scheme), the link key theme=light|dark or
forkTheme.set(); the plots' layout colours of the original's dark plot theme are swapped
for light ones when a plot is drawn, the field colour scales stay. Two hooks in <head>.
